                                    <p class="- topic/shortdesc shortdesc" css:display="block" css:margin-bottom="0.5em" css:margin-left="0" css:margin-right="0" css:margin-top="0.5em">Go to <strong class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ph b" css:display="inline" css:font-weight="bold">MyAccess</strong> (go/myaccess)
                                        to request the necessary roles.</p>
                                    <ul class="- topic/ul ul" css:display="block" css:list-style-type="disc" css:margin-bottom="1.33em" css:margin-top="1.33em" css:padding-left="40px" id="unique_2_Connect_42_ul_cbz_2dk_53c" nd:nd-id="ul_cbz_2dk_53c">
                                        <li class="- topic/li li" css:display="list-item">To use
                                            Harness: <strong class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ph b" css:display="inline" css:font-weight="bold">PP_SSO_Harness_io_platform_operator</strong></li>
                                        <li class="- topic/li li" css:display="list-item">To deploy
                                            to Production: <strong class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ph b" css:display="inline" css:font-weight="bold">PP_HRZ_SITEAD_Altus_Deployment</strong> (you must
                                            also have current <strong class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ph b" css:display="inline" css:font-weight="bold">SRE IPCF
                                                Training</strong>, previously known as "Think
                                            Twice"),</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p class="- topic/p p" css:display="block" css:margin-bottom="0.5em" css:margin-left="0" css:margin-right="0" css:margin-top="1em">Requests go to
                                        your manager for approval and may take 40 minutes to sync.
                                        For information about other roles, see <strong class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ph b" css:display="inline" css:font-weight="bold">Harness.io Roles in
                                            MyAccess</strong>.</p>
                                    <p class="- topic/p p" css:display="block" css:margin-bottom="0.5em" css:margin-left="0" css:margin-right="0" css:margin-top="1em">To log in to
                                        Harness, go <strong class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ph b" css:display="inline" css:font-weight="bold">here</strong>, click the "Single sign-on" button, and
                                        enter your PayPal email address.</p>
